# The relative clause "i d-iteddun" ("that comes") after a unit or weekday.
# Kabyle sentences on Tatoeba:
#   9724592 "Ad ruḥeɣ imalas i d-iteddun."   -- "I am leaving next week."
#   8214457 "Ad ruḥeɣ ddurt i d-iteddun."    -- "I'm leaving next week."
#   13097027 "Ssarameɣ ad kem-ẓreɣ imalas i d-iteddun." -- "I hope to see you next week."
i d iteddun
